Description: Add vo=avfoundation, a video output that hands VideoToolbox
 frames to a host supplied AVSampleBufferDisplayLayer.
 .
 The system only composites video it owns: Picture in Picture and the lock
 screen's now playing surface both read from an AVSampleBufferDisplayLayer or
 an AVPlayerLayer, and neither can be fed from a CAMetalLayer. With hwdec set
 to videotoolbox the decoder already produces CVPixelBuffers, so this output is
 a handoff rather than a conversion.
 .
 Hardware frames only, and no OSD compositing yet. Timing stays with mpv:
 samples carry the DisplayImmediately attachment and no timestamps. Geometry
 stays with the host, which sizes the layer and sets videoGravity.
Author: Plankton
Origin: other
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-08-10

